      "SPECIAL ABILITIES": [
        "Crunch (Ex)",
        "Once every 1d4 rounds as a swift action, the warg wolf can bite an additional time while tearing some flesh from their opponent. If they succeed at hitting with their bite attack, the damage is 1d6+4 plus 1d4 bleed per round for 2 rounds."
      ],
      "DESCRIPTION": [
        "The leader of the wolves. Wolves instinctually move in packs, at the center of which warg wolf are often found. They usually communicate by howling, and are good at coordinating their efforts when stalking prey. Originally, this species was not known to attack humans unprovoked, but lately there have been a fair amount of reports claiming attacks by packs of wolves."
      ]
